				<wikidot:authorName>Doctor GE Smith</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1786409</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Fun theory that only works within the context of this one tale!</p> <p>The GOC and UNIT are the same group, just different designations used in different circles. They both apply firepower to anomolous things as their primary activity, after all.<br /> The doctor did have one involuntary travelling companion from the GOC/UNIT, an MD who fled the Doctor at the earliest opportunity: Harry Sullivan.<br /> Alto Clef is Harry Sullivan.<br /> And regarding his polymorphism, it was strongly suggested in a BBC novel that Harry Sullivan became infected with lycanthropy while bearing the Holy Grail&#8230;</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
