				<wikidot:authorName>Ihp</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1267048</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>That's the whole point of Project Crossover, though. So people can write shitty crossover fanfics.</p> <p>That being said&#8230; this isn't anything impressive. Maybe it's because I don't terribly like the new Doctor Who (11, not 12; I have no opinion on him because he's not around yet), but seeing this bowtie-wearing bimbo run around the Foundation just doesn't feel right. Also, his connection with 682 feels shoehorned in for the sake of a Dalek reference. No vote.</p> <p>E: Actually, there's one more thing wrong with it. I don't see why Bright feels the need to cram in Story!Bright's family in everywhere he writes. It's getting old.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
